只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH × Blender 直连插件 v3.0.6：15 个模型工具让 AI 驱动 GUI Blender（视口 / 自定义视角 / 无头 worker / 作业层 / 事务回滚 / 配方库），34 family / 228 op 契约层；npm 安装 + addon zip，GUI 优先、无头备用；dsh-TUI 选中 chip / @ 提及 / /blender，随包建模 skill，支持 WSL / Windows / macOS。","id":"gh:1368569221","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-blender-plugin","slug":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-blender-plugin","topics":["3d-modeling","ai-agent","automation","blender","bpy","cycles","dsh","dsh-plugin","tooling"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH × Blender 直连插件 v3.0.6：15 个模型工具让 AI 驱动 GUI Blender（视口 / 自定义视角 / 无头 worker / 作业层 / 事务回滚 / 配方库），34 "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"family / 228 op 契约层；npm 安装 + addon zip，GUI 优先、无头备用；dsh-TUI 选中 chip / @ 提及 / /blender，随包建模 skill，支持 W"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"SL / Windows / macOS。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH × Blender"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH × Blender connects DeepSeek Harness to Blender so an agent can build, inspect, validate, and exp"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ort 3D scenes in a real Blender session. The normal workflow is GUI-first: start Blender, connect th"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e addon, and let the agent look, change, and verify. When no GUI is available, background headless j"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"obs (`blender_run(kind=\"headless\")`) still execute scripts and return rendered frames."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Features\n- Quick start\n- Tools\n- Documentation\n- Troubleshooting\n- Development\n- Support\n- License"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **GUI-first interactive modeling.** The agent works against the Blender session you are looking at"},{"id":"p8s2","text":". It can inspect the scene, run Python in a persistent kernel, take a viewport or custom-angle frame"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", and iterate one step at a time.\n- **Headless jobs with visual feedback.** If Blender has no GUI, t"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"he agent submits a background headless job (`blender_run(kind=\"headless\")`) and collects scripts, lo"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"gs, and rendered frames from it. Live step-by-step interaction needs a GUI session; the job path exi"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"sts so long or fresh-scene work still gets done.\n- **Reference-image measurement.** Measure silhouet"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"tes, holes, symmetry, readable features, and scale from a reference image before modeling. If no sca"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"le is known, the tools return pixel units instead of inventing millimeters.\n- **Parametric surfaces."},{"id":"p8s9","text":"** Build reproducible surface meshes from sections (loft), a profile swept along a rail, or a four-s"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"ided patch; run continuity, curvature, self-intersection, and thickness checks; then export GLB. The"},{"id":"p8s11","text":" same spec yields the same `spec_hash` and vertices instead of hand-sculpted geometry.\n- **Assembly "},{"id":"p8s12","text":"audit and repair.** Validate an assembly manifest, classify clashes, hidden overlaps, contacts, gaps"},{"id":"p8s13","text":", floating parts, and contained parts, apply safe repairs, gate the result, and export GLB, FBX, or "},{"id":"p8s14","text":"OBJ with a manifest and merge ledger.\n- **Blockout and video-reference packs.** Build low-poly block"},{"id":"p8s15","text":"outs from declarative parts, render orthographic and perspective reference views, and produce a turn"},{"id":"p8s16","text":"table MP4 for video models such as Seedance.\n- **Visual acceptance and delivery gates.** Compare ren"},{"id":"p8s17","text":"ders against references from the same camera, report defects with crops and measurements, run defect"},{"id":"p8s18","text":"-injection evaluation, and block delivery when the gate is not pass.\n- **Automation and long jobs.**"},{"id":"p8s19","text":" `blender_run` submits render or headless work and returns a job id immediately; parameter searches "},{"id":"p8s20","text":"and batch validation run inside the GUI session through `blender_op`. Neither occupies the GUI for t"},{"id":"p8s21","text":"he whole run.\n- **Native selection.** Select objects or collections in Blender and send them into th"},{"id":"p8s22","text":"e current DSH draft.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Before anything else: install the bundled addon first.** Use the addon shipped in this repository:"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" **extension/dsh_blender_bridge.zip**. It must be your only Blender-side *agent bridge*: do not inst"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"all or run `MCP for Blender`, `blender_mcp`, or any other addon that serves Blender over its own soc"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ket. The 3.1 addon dials the Gateway and opens no inbound port, but a legacy MCP bridge still listen"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"s on 127.0.0.1:9876; two Blender-side agent bridges confuse the host. Unrelated addons (modeling, ma"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"terials, rendering, asset libraries) are fine and are neither checked nor blocked. Install and enabl"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"e this addon in Blender before the other steps. If the installation below does not work, first check"},{"id":"p10s8","text":" that this exact addon is installed, enabled, and connected."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- DSH (DeepSeek Harness) installed and working.\n- Node.js 24.9 or newer is needed only for source bu"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ilds; installing from npm uses the runtime bundled with DSH. Node.js 24.9 is the minimum supported v"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ersion; CI runs on Node 24.\n- Blender 4.2 LTS is the tested version. Blender 4.x may work; Blender 5"},{"id":"p12s4","text":".x is not yet validated. GUI mode requires the bundled addon (install it first); headless mode only "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"needs the Blender executable.\n- Addon compatibility: the bundled addon is the only required addon an"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"d the only supported agent bridge. Other addons do not conflict; an old `MCP for Blender` / `blender"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"_mcp` is unsupported (it still listens on 127.0.0.1:9876) — disable it, no need to uninstall.\n- Opti"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"onal: a DSH source checkout when rebuilding the host side; otherwise the build links against this re"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"pository's installed dependencies."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Option A: install from npm"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"This is the supported installation path. It does not require `git clone`, `npm ci`, or `npm run buil"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s is the supported installation path. It does not require `git clone`, `npm ci`, or `npm run build`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. **Install the bundled addon first.** Download `dsh_blender_bridge.zip` from the latest GitHub Rel"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ease, then in Blender open `Edit > Preferences > Extensions > Install from Disk...`, select the zip,"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" enable **DSH Blender Bridge**, open the `N` panel in the 3D view, and click **Connect**."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"2. **Install the DSH plugin from npm.** Choose the path for your DSH host:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **DSH Web or DSH TUI:** install into the profile you actually run:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"dsh plugin --profile <profile> add dsh-blender-plugin@3.1.0-alpha.1"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then restart DSH in step 3."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **DSH Desktop:** open the Plugins page and install the bundle `dsh-blender-plugin@3.1.0-alpha.1`. "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"DSH Desktop applies the bundle from the Plugins page and does not need a DSH restart."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"3. **Restart DSH (DSH Web and DSH TUI only).** If you installed from the DSH Desktop Plugins page, s"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"SH (DSH Web and DSH TUI only).** If you installed from the DSH Desktop Plugins page, skip this step."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"4. **Verify the installation.** The only acceptance criterion for the GUI route is `doctor` returnin"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"g `kind` equal to `ok`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"curl -sS http://127.0.0.1:39877/doctor"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"GUI route: `curl -sS http://127.0.0.1:39877/health` and `/doctor`; `doctor.kind` must be `ok`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Headless-only route (no addon): `blender_run(action=\"submit\", kind=\"headless\", script=\"print('ok')\")"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"` followed by `wait`/`collect` must return the job and its outputs."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
